+    """Return the exact durable tip proof for a bound hidden game session.
+
+    This is called only after the agent has finished the turn and
+    ``_sync_session_key_after_compress`` has re-anchored ``session_key``.  The
+    SessionDB method resolves and validates the whole root-to-tip chain in one
+    SQLite read snapshot.  Omitting the optional assertion would permit a
+    second compression rotation between the gateway state and the proof, so
+    the current stored key is asserted explicitly.
